","text":"そうみたいですね！\n1年くらい前に聖の青春読んで\nすごく感銘を受けて、\nこの本がきっかけで棋力向上だけでなく\n将棋界を知りたい！と思うようになったので\nどんな映画になるのか\nすごくすごく楽しみです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/22/5340780/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このタイトル(第129話)、ＮＨＫ教育テレビの「おかあさんといっしょ」の曲のタイトルじゃなかったかな？意識してる？ｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付く人いたーーーーー！\n大好きな大好きな2歳の彼が\n今この曲にハマっているので\nタイトルにしてみたよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡公演中です～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラーメンおいしい♡\nもつ鍋おいしい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村さんと一緒に永遠と2人で食べたよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/22/5340780/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-38745":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/05/24/9866413/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3rdアルバム\n「生まれてから初めて見た夢」\nリリースされました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非感想聞かせてください( ˆωˆ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂46 3rdアルバムリリースを\n皆でお祝いしようスペシャル！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はいくちゃんとふたりで\nSHOWROOMに出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/26